                    <h2 className="text-base font-black text-[#00468B] uppercase tracking-widest">Shift Overview Calendar</h2>
                    <p className="text-sm text-slate-500">Historical logs of team deployment. Click a day to see its overview. Click a shift block to open that shift's Personnel Gantt.</p>
